["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">善</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>善良；良好；善行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ゼン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.い・い.い・よ.く・よし.とする</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">善</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">善；善良；正义；美德</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">改善</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改善；改进；改良；改善（日本企业持续改进的经营理念）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">最善</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいぜん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">最好；最佳；极致</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">逮</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>逮捕；追捕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">逮捕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいほ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">逮捕；拘捕；捕获</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">迫</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>逼迫；紧迫；催促；强行</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">せま.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">迫る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せまる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">逼近；临近；迫在眼前；催促；强迫；逼迫</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">圧迫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">あっぱく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">压力；压迫；压制；压迫；镇压</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脅迫</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きょうはく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">威胁；恐吓；强迫；勒索</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">惑</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>迷惑；困惑；蛊惑</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ワク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">まど.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">迷惑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めいわく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">麻烦；烦扰；困扰；不便；感到困扰；被烦扰；感到不便</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">疑惑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぎわく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">怀疑；疑虑；不信任；猜疑</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">誘惑</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ゆうわく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">诱惑；引诱；勾引；诱人的事物</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">崩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>崩溃；倒塌；毁坏；死亡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ホウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くず.れる・-くず.れ・くず.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">崩す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くずす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">摧毁；拆除；推倒；夷平；扰乱；打乱；破坏平衡；动摇；放松姿态；使自己放松；兑换；找零；写成草体；用行书书写；露出笑容；展颜一笑；降价</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">崩れる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くずれる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">坍塌；崩塌；破裂；变形；散乱；不整洁；失去形状；瓦解；陷入混乱；暴跌；下滑；衰退（股市等）；兑换零钱；破钞；恶化；变坏；（天气等）转差</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">雪崩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なだれ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">雪崩；雪滑；雪崩；雪崩定石</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">紀</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>世纪；记载；历史；（地质）纪；编年史</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">世紀</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">せいき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">世纪；时代；年代；世纪的；世纪之战般的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">聴</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>听；收听；询问；准许</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ・テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">き.く・ゆる.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">聴覚</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうかく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">听觉；听觉感知</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">聴講</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">旁听；听讲</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">聴診器</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょうしんき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">听诊器</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">脱</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>脱去；脱落；脱离；逃脱；去除</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ぬ.ぐ・ぬ.げる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱ぐ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぬぐ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脱掉；脱下；脱去</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱線</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だっせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">脱轨；出轨；离题；跑题；偏题</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">脱出</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だっしゅつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">逃脱；逃出；脱离；脱垂；脱出</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">級</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>等级；年级；班级</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">級</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（学校的）年级；班级；等级；级别；档次；级；级位（武术、围棋、将棋等中段位以下的等级）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">学級</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がっきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（学校的）班级；班</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高級</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高级；高档；高端；高质量；奢侈；高级；高层；资深</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">博</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>博士；博学；博览；博爱；博得</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハク・バク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">博士</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はかせ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">专家；学者；博士；博士学位；皇宫讲师（律令时代）；佛教诵经的音调和长度标记</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">博物館</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はくぶつかん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">博物馆</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">締</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>收紧；系紧；关闭；锁住；固定</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">し.まる・し.まり・し.める・-し.め・-じ.め</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">締める</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しめる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">系；扎；拧紧；系（领带、腰带）；扎紧；合计；求和；统计；严格对待；严厉要求；节省；节约；削减开支；腌制；腌渍；做寿司时加醋盐混合物；宰杀；杀死（鱼、家禽等）；严厉施压；镇压；严格控制</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">締切</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しめきり</span><span class=\"k-wz\">截止期限；截止时间；截稿时间；关闭；闭合；围堰；防水堤</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">締め切る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しめきる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">关紧；紧闭（门窗等）；关严；截止；停止受理（如期限已过，或截止认购、报名）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">救</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>拯救；救助；救援；挽救；救赎</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">キュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すく.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">救助</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうじょ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">救济；救援；救助</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">救う</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">すくう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">救援；拯救；解救；救济；救赎；拯救；解救</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">救援</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうえん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">救援；救助</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">執</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>执行；执着；抓住；办理；执笔</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シツ・シュウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">と.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">執筆</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しっぴつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">写作；著述；撰写</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">執着</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうちゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">执着；执念；坚持；固着；痴迷</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">房</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>房间；穗状物；簇；流苏；瓣</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ボウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふさ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だんぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">（室内）供暖；暖气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">冷房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">れいぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">空调；制冷</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">女房</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">にょうぼう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">妻子；自己的妻子；宫女；女官；在宫中侍奉的女性；女性；（尤指）心仪的女性；爱慕对象</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">撤</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>撤去；撤回；拆除；排除；撤销</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">密</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>秘密；密度；细微；缜密</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ミツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ひそ.か</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">密</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">稠密；浓厚；拥挤；亲密；紧密；细致；精密；周密；秘密；机密；密教；秘传佛教</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">秘密</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ひみつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">秘密；保密；机密；隐私；谜；神秘；诀窍；窍门；秘传；密教</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過密</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かみつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">过度拥挤；拥塞；人口过剩；（日程等）排得很满；拥挤；繁忙；紧张</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">措</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>搁置；中止；放弃；除外；放置</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">お.く</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">措置</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">措施</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">志</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>志向；意图；决心；希望；先令（英国旧货币）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シリング・こころざ.す・こころざし</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意志</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いし</sp