ng=\"ja\">よくあつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抑制；制止；压制；镇压</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">抑制</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よくせい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">控制；抑制；压制；约束；限制；阻止；遏制</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">幕</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>幕（戏剧的幕）；帘子；帷幕；（戏剧的）幕</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マク・バク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">とばり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">幕</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">まく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">幕；帷幕；幕（戏剧的一场）；幕落；闭幕；终；结束；闭幕；情况；场合；角色；部分；幕内（相扑最高级别）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">染</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>染色；沾染；浸染；印染；涂色</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">セン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そ.める・そ.まる・し.みる・し.み</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">汚染</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">污染；污秽</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">伝染</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">でんせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">传染；感染</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">感染</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんせん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">感染；传染；被感染；受感染；受影响；被不良思想所感染</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">奈</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>奈良（日本古都）；什么（疑问词）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み